  entry: 
  a: Use a Flight or Levitation Spell (gagana lang pag may ganyan sila skill)
  b: 'Option 2: Use the Chronicle of Icarus'
  c: 'Option 3: Jump Across (Athletics DC 14)'
  d: 
  dialogText: "You arrive at a shattered bridge, hanging over a vast, dark abyss.
    The only way forward is across\u2026 but how?"
  dialogImage: {fileID: 5916992838340607457, guid: d92a9d76b52d4be4b8b930afaec42704, type: 3}
  backgroundMusic: 0
