  entry: 
  a: Attempt to Communicate with the Watcher
  b: Break the Seal & Release the Watcher
  c: Reinforce the Seal & Leave the Watcher Bound
  d: 
  dialogText: "The sealed doorway looms ahead, but now the players can see the figure
    bound before it. The Watcher remains. A being of both light and shadow, it flickers
    between anger and sorrow, its voice distant but filled with something\u2026 human.
    \n\n\"I was made to protect. To guard. To watch. And now\u2026 I do not know
    what I am.\" \n"
  dialogImage: {fileID: -6335991583029726788, guid: af6a70d63512ee14497eacb536c8ef83, type: 3}
  backgroundMusic: 0
