  a: "Left Path \u2013 Arcane Corridor  "
  b: "Right Path \u2013 Whispering Abyss "
  c: 
  d: 
  dialogText: "\u201CNyxholm was the last frontier of our knowledge. Here, the greatest
    minds wove power beyond our grasp. But one truth was clear: some doors were never
    meant to be opened.\u201D\n"
