  entry: 
  dialogText: "Once all players introduce themselves, \nMalrik steps forward, his
    deep voice cutting through the chamber like a blade: \u201CWords are wind. I
    want to know if you can fight. Can you stand against the horrors that lurk in
    the dark?\u201D \nCassiel raises a hand, silencing the Inquisitor."
  exit: 
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 4113829005332862926, guid: cdd217edbda59354eb6b16ee916fc8e6, type: 3}
  backgroundMusic: 0
