  entry: 
  dialogText: "Reward: Players gain Watcher\u2019s Mark                                                                         
    \nYou shatter the golden runes, freeing the Watcher! The chamber shakes violently,
    and the Nexus pulses erratically. The Watcher is unleashed, but its uncontrolled
    energy threatens to destabilize everything."
  exit: 
